    <itunes:duration>01:27:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuKvWFppKk8jIBlT4x9CTNxKwxoa.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>对话Amico BJ郭强丨高端西餐关店潮下，我们在经历什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6680ffdd077b88831b2fc633</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6680ffdd077b88831b2fc633</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎大家收听《食不order》，这是一档为餐饮创业者们准备的播客节目，我们在这里与全国著名餐厅的主理人们聊商业逻辑、饮食文化和创业机会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本来这个播客我预计是每两周更新一期，但最近工作上的事情比较多，中间还回重庆办了一场婚礼，所以拖更了很久，跟关注这档节目的听友们说声抱歉，争取以后还是能再高产一点！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【单集介绍 - Amico BJ - 郭强】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的嘉宾是我的老朋友——Amico BJ的主理人老郭。Amico曾经蝉联了好几年的黑珍珠二钻，也是米其林推荐的常客。我的老板狗哥曾经吃完Amico之后赞不绝口，一度感叹中国的西餐fine dining只认外国脸的时代要过去了。可惜近两年来，市场不尽人意，当北京有名有姓的高端西餐正在纷纷关店、跑路的当下，Amico已经步履蹒跚地走过了第8个年头，好在他们也开始拥抱一些新变化，绝对值得我们期待。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loqXGHEgQ7CKDKU9rPupPcO7u_tQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> &nbsp;Amico BJ的开业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> &nbsp;关于老郭的过往经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> &nbsp;Amico BJ老店的选址、建店成本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> &nbsp;Amico BJ的原始股东、初始团队构成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a> &nbsp;刚开业的生意来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a> &nbsp;如何看待黑珍珠、米其林带来的流量？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> &nbsp;关于搬店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> &nbsp;细聊餐厅经营遇到的各种压力、琐事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> &nbsp;亲历者讲述2021-2024餐饮市场变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> &nbsp;关于意面事务局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2344">39:04</a> &nbsp;对未来经营的考虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a> &nbsp;非常重要：对年轻餐饮从业者的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a> &nbsp;开一间餐厅至少得先留出哪些钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其它推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">52:15</a> &nbsp;犬生活 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660586822d9eae5d0aaa0613" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660586822d9eae5d0aaa0613"><span>《美食就是当代人的博物课》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播诨号陈不诌，供职于凤凰网美食，偶尔客串纪录片撰稿。撰稿作品包括《航拍中国》西藏和北京、《风味原产地·贵阳》、《寻味贵阳》。曾经是个 e 人，采访过很多有名、有趣的餐饮人，近来受经济周期影响，有转 i 倾向。</span></p>]]></description>
