    <itunes:duration>00:38:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmCd_NfyM8AMMcLL81iqTJt-3QRw.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【行业观察者】对话一大口美食小宽丨2024年，餐饮还是一门好生意吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c1f0880847349e0c017d0c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c1f0880847349e0c017d0c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Feb 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎大家收听《食不order》，这是一档为餐饮创业者们准备的播客节目。我们在这里与全国著名餐厅的主理人们聊商业逻辑、饮食文化和创业机会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【单集介绍 - 一大口美食 - 小宽】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是《食不order》的番外节目。邀请的嘉宾不是餐厅的经营者，而是一位见证了20年中国餐饮行业变革的观察者。他是《舌尖上的中国》的第一、二季顾问，一大口美食机构的创始人小宽。</span></p><span></span><p><span>注：点击阅读小宽</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Av2sNzL8g3XGNPoLuNXl1Q" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Av2sNzL8g3XGNPoLuNXl1Q"><span>2020</span></a><span>、2023（</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JCgQgU_0N4hLlyZAcGMmmw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JCgQgU_0N4hLlyZAcGMmmw"><span>上</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/I5erJ4avQ5QsWIrGL5veMw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/I5erJ4avQ5QsWIrGL5veMw"><span>下</span></a><span>）、</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bdfmPzDsqPs9nNBiYguxKg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bdfmPzDsqPs9nNBiYguxKg"><span>2024</span></a><span>年的年度行业分析。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuE9VC5u0TOiBHj5j7xwY5T9PPRb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>关于2019年底写下的十条预测：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> &nbsp;第一条：不要开餐厅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a> &nbsp;第二条：20年代餐饮看深圳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a> &nbsp;第三条：主厨时代降临</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> &nbsp;第四条：本地化风潮开启</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> &nbsp;第五条：商场业态升级带来机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> &nbsp;第六条：空缺市场皆为下沉市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> &nbsp;第七条：爆品单品思路失灵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1676">27:56</a> &nbsp;第八条：网红餐厅逻辑升级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> &nbsp;第九条：精致餐饮遇到困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> &nbsp;第十条：不要开餐厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于2024年的其它问题：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2157">35:57</a> &nbsp;2024年，Bistro还能做吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2464">41:04</a> &nbsp;Bistro能做下沉市场吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a> &nbsp;2024年，日料有机会翻身吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2675">44:35</a> &nbsp;应该做“小区域”的“小菜系”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> &nbsp;做精致餐饮不用管黑粉？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播诨号陈不诌，供职于凤凰网美食，偶尔客串纪录片撰稿。撰稿作品包括《航拍中国》西藏和北京、《风味原产地·贵阳》、《寻味贵阳》。曾经是个 e 人，采访过很多有名、有趣的餐饮人，近来受经济周期影响，有转 i 倾向。</span></p>]]></description>
